Yesterday, moonshots KimiK 3.1 Pro brought frontier-level coding and agent performance to

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:11.610
a 2.8 trillion parameter mixture of experts model, with open weights due November 4.

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:16.870
Reenforcement learning also pushed some models to abandon English in chain of thought traces,

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.370
